If I was in your position, I'd be trying to consolidate a little fort
somewhere. That way, when the inevitable happens, you've got somewhere
to flee to and heal up (assuming you survive the encounter by the skin
of your teeth, obviously). If you have the resources, then keeping a
fort every couple of levels will help reduce the amount of fleeing
time; as you know, running pell-mell through the dungeon for extended
periods is an excellent way to become slightly dead.

